    <h1>Every student has <span class="mark">a way in.</span> I help find it.</h1>

    <div class="window panel">
      <div class="scene" id="scene"></div>
      <div class="hint">Click the owl. He has thoughts.</div>
    </div>

    <p class="lead">Hi, I'm <b>Noelle Long</b>, a special education teacher who builds learning with clear routines, visual supports, art, and play. Strengths come first, goals stay specific, and students, families, and teammates stay on the same page.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
